  "texts": {
    "preamble": "K.Naga Malleswararao vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh, on 9 October, 2020 Author: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Bench: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy 1 Cmr, J. Crl. P.Nos.4291 of 2020 & Batch Hon'Ble Sri Justice Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Crl. Petition Nos.4291, 4337, 4360 and 4367 of 2020 Common Order:",
    "facts": "Since all these Criminal Petitions are filed seeking quash of the proceedings relating to similar nature of offences based on identical facts, these Criminal Petitions are heard together and they are being disposed of by this Common Order. 3. The petitioners sought quash of the criminal proceedings initiated against them on the ground that \"tobacco\" does not fall within the definition of \"food\" as defined in Section 3(i)(j) of the FSS Act.",
    "arguments": "4. Learned counsel for the petitioners would also submit that these matters are squarely covered by the earlier orders of this Court and the criminal proceedings initiated against the petitioners therein based on similar facts for the similar offences are already [LEAKAGE_MASK] by this Court.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "4. Learned counsel for the petitioners would also submit that these matters are squarely covered by the earlier orders of this Court and the criminal proceedings initiated against the petitioners therein based on similar facts for the similar offences are already [LEAKAGE_MASK] by this Court.",
